<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9e0d059c">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Drivers impact an organization&apos;s ability to accomplish business objectives
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Drivers include responses to trends in internal and external environments. A few common examples include: 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Globalization
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Regulatory
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Customer experience
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Technology innovation
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Cybersecurity
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
